	(text "VSYS clamp (rev 1.2 candidate): absorbs motor regen when there is no battery.\nTrips at 1.24 V x (1 + 340k/100k) = about 5.45 V (U3 TPS63802 VIN max 5.5 V, abs 6 V).\nTLV431B (0.5%) with R26 1% and R27 0.1%: trip about 5.30-5.74 V over -40..85 C (5.35-5.68 V at 25 C), above any in-spec USB supply.\nTLV431 DBZ pinout: 1 REF, 2 K, 3 A (not the TL431 order). C23 compensation: check on the bench." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 315.00 30.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1ba87706-58f1-4c51-b03f-eb4c09ee4771"))
